{"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SCSelectionSection(py)maximumSelections","modules":[{"name":"STV"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"maximumSelections"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"maximumSelections","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"maximumSelections"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionSection\/maximumSelections-c.property","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionSection"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The maximum number of items that can be selected. Set to zero to allow an infinite number of selections. Default: 0."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionsection\/maximumselections-c.property"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"readwrite","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSUInteger","text":"NSUInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maximumSelections","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only applicable when allowMultipleSelection is TRUE."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCSelectionSection/maximumSelections-c.property":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"maximumSelections","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionSection\/maximumSelections-c.property","type":"topic","title":"maximumSelections","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionsection\/maximumselections-c.property","abstract":[{"text":"The maximum number of items that can be selected. Set to zero to allow an infinite number of selections. Default: 0.","type":"text"}]},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build data-driven UIKit table interfaces with Sensible TableView."}],"url":"\/documentation\/stv","role":"collection","title":"STV"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCSelectionSection":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"SCSelectionSection","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionSection","type":"topic","title":"SCSelectionSection","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionsection","abstract":[{"text":"This class functions as an SCTableViewModel section that is able to provide selection functionality.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The cells in this section represent different items that the end-user can select from, and they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are generated from NSStrings in its items array. Once a cell is selected, a checkmark appears next","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to it, similar to Apple’s Settings application where a user selects a Ringtone for their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iPhone. The section can be configured to allow multiple selection and to allow no selection at all.","type":"text"}]}}}